<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Quick 1996 profit falls 48 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian Quick 1996 profit falls 48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    net profit				  0.312 vs     0.598</p>
<p>    extraordinary expenses		  0.178 vs     0.014</p>
<p>    total sales				21.507 vs    19.551 (=up</p>
<p>10 percent)</p>
<p>    number of restaurants		    371  vs    318</p>
<p>NOTE - Quick Restaurants is a unit of Belgian GIB Group. Unaudited figures. Quick said that while total sales were up 10 percent, comparable sales were down 5.8 percent.  </p>
<p>    sales and franchise revenues	 11.581 vs    11.801</p>
<p>    operating profit			  0.909 vs     1.396</p>
<p>    net profit per share (francs)	57.88  vs   111.70</p>
<p>NOTE - final results due on March 14.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
